# Styling rules

- Use **`www/custom.css`** for shared UI. No Tailwind/Bootstrap.
- Simple.css was early inspiration; the project uses its own **`custom.css`**, not the Simple.css package.
- **Classes and IDs** are allowed (`hidden`, `#item-list` grids, `.game-notice`).
- **Inline styles** in JS templates are OK when needed for one-off layout (battle bars, dynamic UI).
- Prefer adding a rule to `custom.css` if the same layout appears twice.
- Toggle screens with **`class="hidden"`** / `classList`.
- In-game text: **English**.
